## User

A list holding n copies of an element.

## Type

type
```agda
copies : {A : Set} → ℕ → A → List A
```

## Term

```agda
copies zero    x = x ∷ []
copies (suc n) x = x ∷ copies n x
```

## agda

```agda
copies-++ : {A : Set} → (n : ℕ) → (xs ys : List A) → copies n (xs ++ ys) ≡ copies n xs ++ copies n ys
```

## agda

```agda
copies-++ zero    xs ys = refl
copies-++ (suc n) xs ys = cong suc (copies-++ n xs ys)
```

